gement is the basis, rather than an overtime service.\n\nCan you confirm package A so we can place the order on that basis?\n\nHollerau Pumpenwerke, Purchasing", "refs": [], "term_sheets": [{"term_sheet_id": null, "terms": {"unit_price": 5.22, "payment_days": 90, "contract_months": 36}}, {"term_sheet_id": null, "terms": {"unit_price": 5.15, "payment_days": 30, "contract_months": 36}}], "interpreted": {"claims": [{"type": "quality_record", "refs": ["qn:20004893", "qn:20004861", "qn:20004816", "qn:20004790"], "asserted": {"ppm": 296.0}}]}, "supplier_id": "sup:70610"}, "reasons": []}, {"round": 3, "actor": "sup:70610", "move": {"offer_id": "offer:70610-3", "round": 3, "status": "final_offer", "terms": {"unit_price": 5.39, "payment_days": 90, "contract_months": 36}, "alternatives": [], "missing_fields": [], "claims": [], "claim_results": [{"index": 0, "result": "duplicate"}], "signals": {"reply_delay_days": 2, "validity_days": 7}, "text": "Dear customer,\n\nThank you for your ongoing partnership with Schraubenhandel Leitner & Sohn GmbH. We have reviewed the quality notifications you cited; however, this information was already taken into account in our previous pricing. Our current defect rate for you is about 80 ppm. To better understand the disruption costs you mentioned, we kindly ask you to provide the underlying figures.\n\nBuilding on your preferred package with a 36-month contract and 90-day payment terms, we can offer a revised price of EUR 5.39 per kit. For our complete Angebot, our offer is a price of €5.39 per unit, Zahlungsziel 90 days net, a contract term of 36 months. Please note that our price follows our main cost drivers: PPI-C2594, LCI-C. Furthermore, material accounts for about 61 % of our cost; more detail we do not share.\n\nThis is our final offer (letztes Angebot). Please decide. Our Angebot stays valid for 7 days.\n\nMit freundlichen Grüßen\nFranz Stadler\nInside Sales, Schraubenhandel Leitner & Sohn GmbH"}, "reasons": ["We have reviewed the quality notifications you cited; however, this information was already taken into account in our previous pricing.", "To better understand the disruption costs you mentioned, we kindly ask you to provide the underlying figures.", "Building on your preferred package with a 36-month contract and 90-day payment terms, we can offer a revised price of EUR … per kit.", "Our price follows our main cost drivers: PPI-C2594, LCI-C.", "Our current defect rate for you is about … ppm.", "Material accounts for about … of our cost; more detail we do not share."]}, {"round": 3, "actor": "buyer", "move": {"type": "accept", "offer_id": "offer:70610-3", "supplier_id": "sup:70610"}, "reasons": []}]}, "replay_url": "/replay/2a8ab1a965eca24b"}}
